WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.900
Forty-one unread emails. A report due Friday.
A dentist you keep meaning to call.

00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:12.200
Meet Peach. An AI agent that gets
your errands done… and asks before it acts.

00:00:13.260 --> 00:00:14.900
Ask what you missed.

00:00:15.120 --> 00:00:18.600
Peach reads your inbox, and pulls out
the three things that need you.

00:00:21.960 --> 00:00:24.400
Tell it something once, and it remembers.

00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:27.600
Ask for a reminder… and it follows up.

00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:31.300
Need the dentist?

00:00:31.540 --> 00:00:34.900
Peach checks your calendar, calls the office,
and finds a time.

00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:37.000
You just tap approve.

00:00:39.840 --> 00:00:43.800
It finds the subscriptions you forgot about,
and cancels them.

00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:47.400
That's $564 a year… back.

00:00:50.480 --> 00:00:54.300
And when it counts… Peach makes sure
nothing slips.

00:00:58.460 --> 00:01:01.200
But Peach doesn't stop at your errands.

00:01:01.480 --> 00:01:03.400
It can help run your business.

00:01:04.060 --> 00:01:08.200
Give it a team: an accountant,
a salesperson, and a marketer.

00:01:09.640 --> 00:01:15.000
Every agent gets its own phone number,
its own email… and its own computer.

00:01:17.740 --> 00:01:21.600
When a customer calls, Tico picks up,
and books the meeting.

00:01:25.720 --> 00:01:30.700
Ashley chases late invoices from her own inbox,
and keeps the books current.

00:01:34.020 --> 00:01:38.800
Simba builds your marketing on his own computer…
and you can watch him work.

00:01:41.900 --> 00:01:43.700
They work together in one chat.

00:01:43.900 --> 00:01:47.200
And nothing goes out in your name…
until you say yes.

00:01:51.680 --> 00:01:56.200
Peach… Your errands, handled.
Your business, staffed.
